# Security guardrails

- Validate all webhook payload fields (types, ranges). Reject unknown fields (400).
- Never shell-out without checking exit codes; use timeout; capture stdout+stderr.
- Don't log secrets or full payloads; log order_id, user_id, and minimal trace IDs.
- Rate-limit webhook endpoint if exposed publicly (or require a shared signature).
- Use constant-time compare for signatures if implemented.
